cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this data, please cite it as below."
title: "SMA Research -- Open Computational Drug Discovery"
abstract: >-
  Open-source computational drug discovery data and findings for
  Spinal Muscular Atrophy (SMA). Includes 40,000+ compute jobs
  across AlphaFold 3, Boltz-2, Chai-1, DiffDock, GROMACS MD,
  GenMol, and ADMET screening. Pipeline v2.5 with three knowledge
  gates and multi-method consensus. 96 pipeline-complete compounds
  targeting ROCK2 and emerging axes (p38/MK2, NRF2-KEAP1, Kv2.1).
  All artifacts released under CC-BY-4.0.
type: dataset
